GsWoodArmor.EndowLine: Acorn Burst: strikes build sap; at 6 stacks the next strike bursts into three bouncing acorns that shatter into wooden splinters
GsCopperArmor.EndowLine: Conductive Veins: strikes build charge; at 5 stacks the next strike releases a chaining arc that leaps between up to three foes
GsTinArmor.EndowLine: Tin Resonance: strikes build resonance; at 5 stacks the next strike rings out three sonic rings that batter and bewilder foes
GsIronArmor.EndowLine: Tempered Rebuke: taking hits builds temper; at 4 stacks your next strike calls down a quenched forge hammer
GsLeadArmor.EndowLine: Lead Downpour: strikes build lead; at 6 stacks the next strike pours three heavy drops that splash into beads and poison what they touch
GsSilverArmor.EndowLine: Silver Vigil: strikes build moonlight; at 6 stacks a silver moon rises to orbit you, bursting into radiance on contact
GsTungstenArmor.EndowLine: Tungsten Cross: strikes build core pressure; at 5 stacks the next strike erupts four piercing tungsten spikes from the target
GsPlatinumArmor.EndowLine: Regal Hour: strikes build radiance; at 7 stacks the next strike begins the Regal Hour, every blow for 5 seconds looses a homing star shard, ending early if you are struck
GsNinjaArmor.EndowLine: Substitution Log: readies a decoy every 8 seconds; when you are struck it shatters into smoke and hurls three avenging shuriken
GsBeeArmor.EndowLine: Queen's Guard: strikes build brew; at 8 stacks the next strike releases four guard bees to maul the target
GsMeteorArmor.EndowLine: Stray Embers: strikes build starfire; at 7 stacks the next strike calls two burning meteor shards down on your foe
GsJungleArmor.EndowLine: Spore Blight: strikes build spores; at 6 stacks the next strike blooms a lingering cloud that poisons all foes inside
GsJungleArmorAncientCobalt.EndowLine: Spore Blight: strikes build spores; at 6 stacks the next strike blooms a lingering cloud that poisons all foes inside
GsNecroArmor.EndowLine: Bone Uprising: strikes build ossuary and kills feed it faster; at 6 stacks the next strike raises three bone lances from the earth
GsShadowArmor.EndowLine: Umbral Tide: strikes build shadowflame; at 8 stacks the tide rises, each strike within 6 seconds reaps a shadow scythe, and three more spiral out as it ebbs
GsShadowArmorAncient.EndowLine: Umbral Tide: strikes build shadowflame; at 8 stacks the tide rises, each strike within 6 seconds reaps a shadow scythe, and three more spiral out as it ebbs
GsCrimsonArmor.EndowLine: Leech Pact: strikes build blood; at 6 stacks the next strike tears out two crimson leeches that bite your foe and siphon life back to you
GsMoltenArmor.EndowLine: Core Eruption: strikes build magma pressure; at 10 stacks the next strike erupts three lava geysers underfoot, and your attacks ignite foes for 4 seconds after
